  "title": "Underwriting in a Hard Market: Where the Winners Emerge",
  "summary": "In many segments of P&C insurance, the industry is going through what is known as a \"hard market\" in which prices are high and underwriting capacity is scarce. These conditions are due to many simultaneous challenges: economic inflation, financial volatility, unexpectedly high jury awards, expensive reinsurance, and more frequent natural catastrophes.",
